# Cline Rules — GPS Task T1

For canonical project instructions, refer to: [AGENTS.md](/AGENTS.md)

## Summary

This is the GPS desktop environment project developed by the rice user account.
- AI coding agents must follow AGENTS.md for all instructions
- Never modify the guru account or system configuration
- Use GPS_ROOT and XDG paths — never hardcode usernames or home directories
- Never use sudo or pacman — report commands for the user instead
- All changes must be tested via `./tests/run_all.sh`
- Use dedicated Git worktrees for independent tasks
- Preserve existing architecture unless explicitly authorized
- Do not modify application QML or runtime behavior during task T1
- Do not push to GitHub until tests pass and diff is reviewed
